WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:04.066
[music]

2
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:10.166
[Instructor] Now we just need to add
a few more UI elements to our game.

3
00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.500
So we've made it so we
can restart our game.

4
00:00:13.033 --> 00:00:16.033
But we want to be able
to set the difficulty for our Players.

5
00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:19.633
To do that,
we'll actually just duplicate

6
00:00:20.166 --> 00:00:22.300
some of our text and our Buttons.

7
00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:25.466
So our Game Over Text, since our title
will be in the same place.

8
00:00:26.133 --> 00:00:28.700
If we select our Game Over Text,

9
00:00:28.833 --> 00:00:33.800
and duplicate with Control + D,
we have Game Over Text again.

10
00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.800
We'll set this to active.

11
00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:40.000
And I'm going to rename the
text to be our "Title Text."

12
00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:44.566
And then we don't want
our text to be the same

13
00:00:44.566 --> 00:00:47.333
as our Game Over because
that would be really confusing.

14
00:00:47.866 --> 00:00:50.500
So what we'll do
is we'll change our text

15
00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:57.733
and we'll come up with a clever title.
So I'm going to call this "Clicky Crates."

16
00:00:58.566 --> 00:01:02.100
Now I don't want it to be red
so I'm going to change that,

17
00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:04.533
and we'll make
it the exact opposite color.

18
00:01:04.533 --> 00:01:06.600
So that'll be,

19
00:01:08.033 --> 00:01:10.633
let's see maybe a greenish,
maybe a blueish.

20
00:01:10.633 --> 00:01:13.800
Ooh I like that blue, that one
looks good. Maybe a little darker.

21
00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:16.300
There you go. Cool.
So now we have our Clicky Crates.

22
00:01:16.733 --> 00:01:19.800
Now what we also need to do
is make some more Buttons.

23
00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:22.533
So I'll actually take our Restart
Button, and we'll duplicate this.

24
00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:25.733
And we'll set this back to
active so we can see it.

25
00:01:26.933 --> 00:01:29.633
Now our Restart Button, 
this one will be our "Easy Button,"

26
00:01:30.333 --> 00:01:32.466
because we definitely
want to start easy first.

27
00:01:33.266 --> 00:01:35.800
And then we go into our
Easy Button by expanding.

28
00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:37.833
We'll change our text
because we want to make sure

29
00:01:37.833 --> 00:01:40.633
that we know it's easy mode. "Easy."

30
00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:43.533
Now our Button is definitely
a little bit too large

31
00:01:43.533 --> 00:01:45.566
so we'll actually change the width

32
00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:48.300
to make it a bit smaller.

33
00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:57.200
So I'll make it something
like, yeah, something like now.

34
00:01:57.200 --> 00:02:00.000
I like this as a nice round
number so it's easier. So 115,

35
00:02:00.433 --> 00:02:03.766
cool. And then we'll reposition this

36
00:02:03.766 --> 00:02:07.333
so let's see if I move it not on the Y.

37
00:02:07.466 --> 00:02:09.933
In fact I want it to move on the X.

38
00:02:09.933 --> 00:02:11.966
So...

39
00:02:14.133 --> 00:02:16.300
if we move Easy over

40
00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:19.500
to about there, cool.

41
00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:25.233
And then let's see,
so we want to do the same thing.

42
00:02:25.233 --> 00:02:28.366
We'll make a Medium difficulty Button,
so we'll duplicate that.

43
00:02:29.466 --> 00:02:33.466
That time I just right click duplicated.
Call this "Medium Button."

44
00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:38.966
We want to re-change the text
back to "Medium" this time.

45
00:02:40.233 --> 00:02:42.366
Now the problem here is,
our Button is actually on top

46
00:02:42.366 --> 00:02:45.800
of our Easy Button.
So we can't actually see that so,

47
00:02:45.866 --> 00:02:49.333
let's see. Let's put this...
what happens if we put it to zero?

48
00:02:49.566 --> 00:02:51.533
Okay, Button's a little tight.

49
00:02:51.533 --> 00:02:56.633
Let's see if we change the width;
maybe to...100.

50
00:02:56.633 --> 00:02:59.766
Okay, that fits pretty well.
Change our Easy Button back to 100.

51
00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:02.833
Have some nice symmetry.

52
00:03:04.366 --> 00:03:06.766
And then our Medium Button,
we'll do the same thing.

53
00:03:06.766 --> 00:03:10.400
We'll Control + D,
Command + D to duplicate.

54
00:03:11.233 --> 00:03:13.266
So this'll be our "Hard Button"
for hard mode.

55
00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:20.700
And then, let's see,
our Easy Button was about -115.

56
00:03:23.566 --> 00:03:29.733
So to get some good symmetry going,
we'll make this position 115, cool.

57
00:03:29.733 --> 00:03:32.300
Now it's all even.
And then last but not least,

58
00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:35.433
we change the text on our Hard Button
to be "Hard."

59
00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:38.400
And now we have a hard mode.

60
00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:41.033
So that makes it a lot easier
for the Players to see,

61
00:03:41.033 --> 00:03:43.100
what Buttons to press. They don't
really do anything right now.

62
00:03:43.100 --> 00:03:46.033
But it certainly looks really good.
So what you're going to do

63
00:03:46.033 --> 00:03:48.433
is you're going to create
your own Title Text,

64
00:03:48.900 --> 00:03:50.900
and your 3 difficulty Buttons.

65
00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:53.300
So what you can do is
just go right click over

66
00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:57.200
Game Over Text, Duplicate,
and then make sure you rename

67
00:03:57.200 --> 00:04:00.600
that to the title so that way you know
the difference between the two.

68
00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:02.933
You can do the same thing
with the Restart Button

69
00:04:02.933 --> 00:04:05.133
to make each of your different Buttons.

70
00:04:05.133 --> 00:04:08.166
Make sure to set them all to active,
so you can see them back on your scene.

71
00:04:08.166 --> 00:04:11.400
Rename them, reposition them,
and make it look really nice.

72
00:04:12.166 --> 00:04:14.166
Now it's your turn.

73
00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:16.500
[music]
